SUMMARY:Transfiguration panigiri\, Old Kallirachi
LOCATION:Kallirachi\, Thasos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hill village of (old) Kallirachi on the west coast celebrates the Transfiguration on 6 August with a feast organised by its cultural association\, part of the municipal summer programme. The next night (7 August) Skala Kallirachi below holds its harbour festival with a big-name Greek singer. Prinos\, further north\, has a traditional celebration with Thracian-style music around 16 August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/thasos/#kallirachi-transfiguration-panigiri-old-kallirachi
